        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE> as <gr str="7538">rottenness </gr>in his <gr str="6106">bones</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="5"> The <gr str="4284">thoughts </gr>of the <gr str="6662">righteous </gr>
