        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> fruit </STYLE>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="13"> The <gr str="7451">wicked </gr>is <gr str="4170">snared </gr>by the <gr str="6588">transgression </gr>of <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> his </STYLE>
        <gr str="8193">lips</gr>: but the <gr str="6662">just </gr>shall come <gr str="3318">out </gr>of <gr str="4480 6869">trouble</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="14"> A <gr str="376">man </gr>shall be <gr str="7646">satisfied </gr>with <gr str="2896">good </gr>by the <gr str="4480 6529">fruit </gr>of <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> his </STYLE>
        <gr str="6310">mouth</gr>: and the <gr str="1576">recompense </gr>of a <gr str="120">man </gr>'s <gr str="3027">hands </gr>shall be <gr str="7725">rendered </gr>unto him. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="15"> The <gr str="1870">way </gr>of a <gr str="191">fool </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE>
        <gr str="3477">right </gr>in his own <gr str="5869">eyes</gr>: but he that <gr str="8085">hearkeneth </gr>unto <gr str="6098">counsel </gr>
