        <gr str="5707">witness </gr>
        <gr str="4820">deceit</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="18"> There <gr str="3426">is </gr>that <gr str="981">speaketh </gr>like the <gr str="4094">piercings </gr>of a <gr str="2719">sword</gr>: but the <gr str="3956">tongue </gr>of the <gr str="2450">wise </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE>
        <gr str="4832">health</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="19"> The <gr str="8193">lip </gr>of <gr str="571">truth </gr>shall be <gr str="3559">established </gr>
